# /discover-entities

Generalizes Topwater's `/find-companies`. Takes the approved Stage A output
(the {{pipeline.stageA.unitNoun|| "category"}} brief) and pulls a broad,
cheap candidate list of {{vocabulary.entityPlural}} — before any scoring,
before any paid enrichment.

---

## Before anything — reuse check (Rule O4)

Load `standards/OUTPUT-STANDARDS.md` Rule O4. Unit of reuse: the
{{vocabulary.entity}}. A {{vocabulary.entity}} already found by a prior
pull for this {{pipeline.stageA.unitNoun|| "category"}} is not searched for
again; only {{vocabulary.entityPlural}} neither the cached connector pull
nor a prior web sweep found are new.
